samples a pairwise-distinct d by d solution S and then forms B=-HDS, where
D is a random diagonal sign matrix.  The displayed (d+1) by (d+1) matrix is

                [ H D X + B   0 ]
        M(x) =  [                 ],
                [     0         1 ]

