+## Trust and hardness
 
-Generation is inverse: balanced hidden classes are sampled first, then labels and only class-crossing edges are drawn.  If local lists are numbered by position, each edge forbids exactly equal positions, so the planted quadratic-bucket labeling is valid by construction.  The generator never solves its output.  All local gates G1–G9(c) pass, including 0 hits in 200,000 structure-aware guesses and five attacks failing on 8/8 shipping seeds.
