codex
Completed a self-contained Track-B generalized list \(T\)-coloring generator based on [arXiv:1311.0603](https://arxiv.org/abs/1311.0603).

- [Generator module](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1311.0603/gen_1311_0603.py)
- [Self-test report](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1311.0603/selftest_report.json)
- [README](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1311.0603/README.md)
- [Bare oracle transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1311.0603/llm_loop_transcript.jsonl)
- [Hinted transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1311.0603/g9_hinted_transcript.jsonl)
- [Placebo transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1311.0603/g9_placebo_transcript.jsonl)

Key results:

- All local gates pass.
- The construction uses only the paper’s native graph, label lists, and forbidden differences.
- Shipping preset: `medium`, \(n=40\), \(q=5\).
- Structure-aware guessing: 0/200,000.
- Six adversarial attacks: 0/8 successes each.
- Exact DSATUR reference: median 118 nodes and 6,669 operations.
- Bare oracle loop: easy solved 3/3; medium held 0/3.
- Answer: 40 atoms, 149 characters; intended compact route: 160 operations.

The hinted and placebo runs were executed, but OpenRouter quota was exhausted after the valid bare run. Their HTTP 403 errors are preserved as 0/0 diagnostics and are not misreported as model failures.
